    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44293" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">silvōsus</span></b> , a, um, adj.
		silva, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>full of woods</i> or <i>trees</i>, <i>woody</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">saltus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					9, 2, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">rami emicant silvosā multitudine,</span>”
				<i>forestlike</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					12, 5, 11, § 23</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">crebrae arbores et silvosae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vitr. 8,
					1 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			</div>
